## Does instrumental music improve studying?

### Run the test

::: {.codewindow .r .codewindow-dark}
music.R


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="false"}
t.test(quiz_score ~ group, data = music, var.equal = TRUE)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```

	Two Sample t-test

data:  quiz_score by group
t = 1.7335, df = 38, p-value = 0.09112
alternative hypothesis: true difference in means between group music and group silence is not equal to 0
95 percent confidence interval:
 -0.1004822  1.2980566
sample estimates:
  mean in group music mean in group silence 
             7.647986              7.049199 
```


